sweet: sampler backtraces over several lines

The live USB log cuts lines near 250 bytes, so the 16-frame backtrace on one
line lost its callers. Each thread now gets a pc/lr/sp line and then up to
64 frames, 8 per line, as "SMP name tN bt+K ...".

Also (22.10) surya_cpu_idle_mask() and surya_cpu_measure() for the
suryastat=1 measurements in bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c: the scheduler's idle
processors, and one processor's PMCCNTR_EL0 against CNTVCT_EL0 while bound
to it.
